WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Willing to fight for Xia Kingdom

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,760
Tricks are not good at fighting

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:07,840
Leave the logistics support to us. Thank you very much.

4
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:09,690
For Xia Kingdom

5
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:18,070
I really want to kill me, I don’t know what happened, Brother Gu

6
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:19,350
Why is your face bleeding?

7
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,430
Uncle is here

8
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:25,030
You don't want to starve us, do you?

9
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,510
When will we come back?

10
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:31,280
Happy to catch up with me at the beginning of the school year

11
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,250
Wait until those bastards are beaten away

12
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:35,250
Let's go home then

13
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:38,370
Dad said our warrior is unparalleled in the world, big brother

14
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,810
You will definitely win when I grow up

15
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:42,290
I want to be a warrior like you

16
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:45,970
To protect our country, you are ours from now on.

17
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,090
A young soldier of the city defense army.

18
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:48,770
Protect your grandpa well and obey your orders
